<p>You pull your awareness fully into the moment, increasing your stealth detection, see invisibility, defense, and accuracy by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">4, 7, 10, 12, 15</acronym> for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">1, 4, 6, 8, 9</acronym> turns.</p><p>If you have Spin Fate active when you cast this spell, you'll gain a bonus to these values equal to 50% of your spin.</p><p>This spell takes no time to cast.</p>